DreamTreeView:ItemDepths {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamTreeView.h#DreamTreeView:ItemDepths
    src   "One depth per item, parallel to Items / ItemObjects: 0 is a root, 1 is a child of the nearest\npreceding 0, and so on. Missing entries read as 0, so a tree given no depths at all is simply\na flat list -- which is the right thing for it to be."
    text  "每一项一个深度，与 Items / ItemObjects 平行：0 是根，1 是前面最近的那个 0\n的子项，依此类推。缺失的条目按 0 读取，因此完全没有给深度的树就是一个\n扁平的列表——而这正是它应有的样子。"
    state machine
}

DreamTreeView:ItemHasChildren {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamTreeView.h#DreamTreeView:ItemHasChildren
    src   "True when the next item is deeper -- which, in a pre-order flat list, is what a parent is."
    text  "当下一项更深时为 true——在一份前序扁平列表里，更深的就是父项。"
    state machine
}

DreamTreeView:OnGetItemChildren {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamTreeView.h#DreamTreeView:OnGetItemChildren
    src   "Who an item's children are. UMG's OnGetItemChildren, with its signature and its job.\n\nUnbound, the walk falls back to IUITreeViewItem::GetTreeChildren -- the interface the\nbehaviour-side UUITreeView has always used -- so an item class that already implements it needs\nno delegate at all. With neither, every root is a leaf."
    text  "指定某一项的子项是谁。对应 UMG 的 OnGetItemChildren，签名和职责都相同。\n\n未绑定时，遍历会回退到 IUITreeViewItem::GetTreeChildren——即\n行为侧的 UUITreeView 一直使用的接口——因此已经实现了它的项类根本不需要\n委托。两者都没有时，每个根都是叶子。"
    state machine
}

DreamTreeView:OnItemExpansionChanged {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamTreeView.h#DreamTreeView:OnItemExpansionChanged
    src   "Per depth level, in whichever direction the twisty was clicked."
    text  "按每个深度层级，沿点击展开箭头的方向。"
    state machine
}

DreamTreeView:RefreshTree {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamTreeView.h#DreamTreeView:RefreshTree
    src   "Walk the roots again and rebuild the flat source from what the children provider says now.\n\nFor a hierarchy that changed underneath the control -- a node gained a child, a provider now\nanswers differently. Folds survive it: they are kept by item identity, so a node that is still\nin the tree is still folded wherever the walk puts it."
    text  "重新遍历根项，并按照子项提供程序当前的回答重建平铺数据源。\n\n适用于控件底下的层级发生变化的情况——某个节点新增了子项，或某个提供程序\n现在给出了不同的回答。折叠状态会保留：折叠按项标识保存，因此仍在树中\n的节点无论遍历把它放到哪里，都仍保持折叠。"
    state machine
}

DreamTreeView:RootItems {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamTreeView.h#DreamTreeView:RootItems
    src   "The top of the hierarchy, for a tree that is authored as a GRAPH rather than as a flat array.\n\nSet it (or call SetRootItems) and the control walks it with OnGetItemChildren, writing the flat\nItems + ItemDepths pair the rest of this class is written in. Empty is the flat road, where\nItemObjects / Items and ItemDepths are authored directly and nothing walks anything.\n\nNo BlueprintSetter, and the reason is the TYPE: a BlueprintSetter has to take the property's\nown type, and TArray<TObjectPtr<>> is not something a UFUNCTION parameter can be. SetRootItems\ntakes the raw pointers a caller actually has, and is the Blueprint road."
    text  "层级结构的顶层，适用于以图而非平铺数组编写的树。\n\n设置它（或调用SetRootItems）后，控件会用OnGetItemChildren遍历它，写入本类\n其余部分所采用的平铺Items + ItemDepths对。为空时就是平铺路线，此时直接编写\nItemObjects / Items和ItemDepths，不做任何遍历。\n\n没有BlueprintSetter，原因在于类型：BlueprintSetter必须接受属性自身的\n类型，而TArray<TObjectPtr<>>不能作为UFUNCTION参数。SetRootItems\n接受调用方实际持有的原始指针，是蓝图路线。"
    state machine
}

DreamTreeView:SetCollapsedItems {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamTreeView.h#DreamTreeView:SetCollapsedItems
    src   "Replace the whole fold state at once and re-derive the visible rows.\n\nA raw write onto the set used to be picked up only on the next rebuild, which is the difference\nbetween a property and a setter -- and a tree whose folds moved without its rows moving is a\ntree that is lying about where its items are."
    text  "一次性替换整个折叠状态，并重新推导可见行。\n\n过去，对集合的原始写入只会在下次重建时才被识别，这正是属性与设置器之间的\n区别——而折叠状态变了、可见行却没动的树，\n就是在谎报各项所在的位置。"
    state machine
}

DreamTreeView:SetItemDepths {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamTreeView.h#DreamTreeView:SetItemDepths
    src   "Replace the depths alone, for a source that did not move."
    text  "仅替换深度，适用于数据源未移动的情况。"
    state machine
}

DreamTreeView:SetItemExpanded {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamTreeView.h#DreamTreeView:SetItemExpanded
    src   "Moves the twisty, rebuilds the visible rows, then says so. A no-op if it was already there."
    text  "移动展开箭头，重建可见行，随后发出通知。若原本已是该状态，则不做任何操作。"
    state machine
}

DreamTreeView:SetItemExpansion {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamTreeView.h#DreamTreeView:SetItemExpansion
    src   "UMG's name for SetItemExpanded, which is the one this control was written with."
    text  "UMG对SetItemExpanded的称呼，本控件编写时采用的就是这个名称。"
    state machine
}

DreamTreeView:SetItemsWithDepths {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamTreeView.h#DreamTreeView:SetItemsWithDepths
    src   "Replace the source and its depths together, which is the only way they are ever coherent."
    text  "同时替换数据源及其深度，这是二者始终保持一致的唯一方式。"
    state machine
}

DreamTreeView:SetRootItems {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamTreeView.h#DreamTreeView:SetRootItems
    src   "Replace the roots and re-walk. The hierarchical counterpart of SetItemsWithDepths."
    text  "替换根项并重新遍历。这是SetItemsWithDepths的层级对应版本。"
    state machine
}

DreamTreeView:SetStyle {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamTreeView.h#DreamTreeView:SetStyle
    src   "Replace the whole look and re-push it. The indent and the twisty are style, so rows rebuild."
    text  "替换整个外观并重新推送。缩进和展开箭头属于样式，因此会重建行。"
    state machine
}

DreamTreeView:Style {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamTreeView.h#DreamTreeView:Style
    src   "This instance's own look. The project sheet wins while StyleSource says so AND a sheet\nactually exists; with no sheet in the project this IS the look in effect -- which is why it\nstays editable instead of being gated on the enum."
    text  "此实例自身的外观。当 StyleSource 如此指定且项目中确实存在样式表时，项目样式表\n优先；项目中不存在样式表时，此属性就是实际生效的外观——这也是它\n保持可编辑、而不是被枚举加以门控的原因。"
    state machine
}

